        "text": "The platform installs from `https://repo.huaweicloud.com/repository/npm/`. That mirror served rollup `4.68.7` but returned 404 for `4.68.8` (the then-current npm latest). A fresh install had no lockfile, so Vite's `rollup` range resolved to `4.68.8` and failed. The template now declares `overrides: { \"rollup\": \"4.68.7\" }`, which resolves both rollup and its platform packages to the mirrored version. This is a dependency-resolution pin, not an application behavior change."
